Maintainer: Axel Luna <me@axel-luna.com.ar>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-virtualenv, python3, python3-venv, python3-setuptools
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/anomalyco/MintAutoThemeDaemon

Package: mint-dynamic-theme
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-xapp-1.0, libglib2.0-bin, libnotify-bin
Description: Dynamic theme switcher for Linux Mint (Cinnamon, MATE, XFCE)
 Automatically changes the GTK, icon and desktop theme based on
 the dominant color of the current wallpaper.
 .
 - Automatic dominant color detection (ColorThief + Pillow).
 - Multi-desktop support: Cinnamon, MATE and XFCE.
 - Per-wallpaper manual override (mdt set <Color>).
 - Native system tray icon (XApp) and user systemd service.
